title: '[pallet-revive] EVM backend: support CALLCODE opcode'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    fixes https://github.com/paritytech/polkadot-sdk/issues/9573

    Implements the `CALLCODE` opcode in the EVM backend by adding an `Ext::call_code` method that runs the target's code in the current contract's storage context with a fresh `msg.sender` and msg.value from the stack, unblocking YUL inline-assembly `callcode(...)`.
crates:
- name: pallet-revive-fixtures
  bump: minor
- name: pallet-revive
  bump: minor
